Third-party attribution: Tailwind CSS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The pure-PHP engine ships data derived from Tailwind CSS:

  * the preflight base stylesheet, and
  * the default theme (design tokens),

converted from the upstream Tailwind CSS sources into PHP data files under
src/Engine/Data/. Each generated file carries a header naming the generator and
the upstream Tailwind CSS version it was produced from.

